- Oracle parity vs R StMoMo 0.4.1 (SWE males 1950–2000): beta rel diff 2.4e-14, identical loglik.
- Training years to 2019: KOR 17, HRV 19, CHL 28, HKG 34, TWN 50 … SWE 269.
  Design-floor cells: KOR split/EnbPI/copula/LSTM; HRV EnbPI/copula.
- Zero-exposure rows (parser definition): 24,083 with E=0 for ≥1 sex, 15,494 both; ages ≥90.
- Zero-death test cells 2020–24: ISL f 117 / m 68, LUX f 110 / m 72.
- GPU A/B (solo): NB 39.6→8.3 s, NLC 34.6→4.5, CNN 53.9→9.9, LSTM ~1x; the
  tensor cache gave NO speed-up; cross-device runs differ (dropout RNG).
- Schnürch–Korn (2022) Table 3 PICP at nominal 95%, ages 60–89, 2007–2016:
  LC10 74.0, LC20 74.3, ACF 77.2, RNN 86.0, FFNN 97.0, CNN 98.0.

